## How to roll back manually
```yaml
- ansible.builtin.include_role:
    name: jenkins_windows
    tasks_from: rollback
  vars:
    jenkins_backup_dir: '{{ jenkins_backup_dir }}'
    jenkins_rollback_backup_id: '{{ jenkins_run_id }}'
```
